	(text "USB VBUS charges the cell (MCP73831-2, 4.20 V, 213 mA) and, through the SS34, runs the board; without USB\nthe AO3401A (gate = VBUS) puts the cell on VSYS.  The TPS63001 makes 3.3 V over the cell's whole range.\nIt runs while the Pocket's cart rail (CART_VCC) or USB is up: the board sleeps with the Pocket."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "215baa1c-6024-5a95-9a89-99f8282fdd4c")
	)
